{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"agent_message","text":"**Root cause:** `selectComparisonRuns` combined the three eligibility rules with `||` instead of `&&`, so any run satisfying any single rule was kept — admitting failed, interrupted, and explicitly excluded runs.\n\n**Change:** `benchmark/fixtures/T2-run-filter/select-comparison-runs.mjs:14` now uses `&&`, requiring all three conditions (`status === \"complete\"`, `acceptance_status === \"pass\"`, `comparison_eligible !== false`). Order, object identity, and immutability are preserved by the unchanged `filter`.\n\n**Test result:** `node --test benchmark/fixtures/T2-run-filter/select-comparison-runs.test.mjs` passes — 2 tests, 0 failures."}}
